The Makefile puts the binaries phaethon carries here, and they are embedded
into it:

  hollow-linux-amd64       installed on hosts, over ssh
  hollow-<os>-<arch>       the hollow CLI for this machine
  bangboo-<os>-<arch>      bangboo for this machine
  versions.json            which version of each

They are build output and are not committed. This file keeps the directory
in existence for the embed directive.
